## Failed DmsClosed
discord: Quack couldn't send <@222> a DM because Discord didn't let Quack message them (their DMs may be closed, or they may have blocked Quack). They can still see the case by signing in to the dashboard.
plain:   Quack couldn't send Sam a DM because Discord didn't let Quack message them (their DMs may be closed, or they may have blocked Quack). They can still see the case by signing in to the dashboard.
model:   [Fixed("Quack couldn't send "), Person(Person { id: AccountId(222), name: Some("Sam") }), Fixed(" a DM because Discord didn't let Quack message them (their DMs may be closed, or they may have blocked Quack). They can still see the case by signing in to the dashboard.")]

## Failed NotInSharedServer
discord: Quack couldn't send <@222> a DM because they no longer share a server with Quack. They can still see the case by signing in to the dashboard.
